      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "문제요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB38C81CC694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "데덴네요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B370B374B124C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "데덴네가 패배한 것을\n문제로 삼는 사람들이 있어요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B370B374B124AC000020D328BC30D55C0020AC83C744000ABB38C81CB85C0020C0BCB2940020C0ACB78CB4E4C7740020C788C5B4C694002E002E002E00100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아, 물론 <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨를\n탓하려는 건 아니에요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544002C0020BB3CB860002000100002010000000020C528B97C000AD0D3D558B824B2940020AC740020C544B2C8C5D0C694002E00100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무튼, 어째서 패배했는지,\n누구에게 패배했는지는 확인해 보지도 않고<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n사실만을 크게 부풀리려는 사람이 있어서...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BB34D2BC002C0020C5B4C9F8C11C0020D328BC30D588B294C9C0002C000AB204AD6CC5D0AC8C0020D328BC30D588B294C9C0B2940020D655C778D5740020BCF4C9C0B3C40020C54AACE000100001BE00000AC0ACC2E4B9CCC7440020D06CAC8C0020BD80D480B9ACB824B2940020C0ACB78CC7740020C788C5B4C11C002E002E002E00100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "해결 방법에 대해 다방면으로 논의한 결과,\n모르페코를 기용하게 됐어요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D574ACB00020BC29BC95C5D00020B300D5740020B2E4BC29BA74C73CB85C0020B17CC758D55C0020ACB0ACFC002C000ABAA8B974D398CF54B97C0020AE30C6A9D558AC8C0020B410C5B4C694002E00100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "경비원 모르페코들이\n직무를 잘 수행할 수 있을지 확인해 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACBDBE44C6D00020BAA8B974D398CF54B4E4C774000AC9C1BB34B97C0020C7980020C218D589D5600020C2180020C788C744C9C00020D655C778D5740020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비가 되시면\n제게 말을 걸어 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44AC000020B418C2DCBA74000AC81CAC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "경비원 모르페코들과\n승부해 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
